 "body": [
  {
   "from": 0.22,
   "to": 0.66,
   "sid": 1,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "怎么了？"
  },
  {
   "from": 0.66,
   "to": 1.52,
   "sid": 2,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我喜欢篮球电视"
  },
  {
   "from": 1.52,
   "to": 2.54,
   "sid": 3,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我是教练龙祖基"
  },
  {
   "from": 2.54,
   "to": 4.74,
   "sid": 4,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "今天我要向你们展示如何运球"
  },
  {
   "from": 5.42,
   "to": 6.5,
   "sid": 5,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "像专业人士一样"
  },
  {
   "from": 6.5,
   "to": 7.68,
   "sid": 6,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们将从初学者开始"
  },
  {
   "from": 7.68,
   "to": 9.78,
   "sid": 7,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "一路走到最高最先进的方式"
  },
  {
   "from": 10.88,
   "to": 11.7,
   "sid": 8,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "让我们开始吧来吧"
  },
  {
   "from": 11.7,
   "to": 13.74,
   "sid": 9,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "很难打我的头像砖头一样硬"
  },
  {
   "from": 13.74,
   "to": 14.66,
   "sid": 10,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "但我比所有人都难"
  },
  {
   "from": 14.66,
   "to": 15.73,
   "sid": 11,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那就是你"
  },
  {
   "from": 15.875,
   "to": 17.57,
   "sid": 12,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "约翰和我在一起"
  },
  {
   "from": 17.57,
   "to": 18.65,
   "sid": 13,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "谁打大学篮球"
  },
  {
   "from": 18.65,
   "to": 19.21,
   "sid": 14,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "所以他要"
  },
  {
   "from": 19.21,
   "to": 21.33,
   "sid": 15,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "一定能帮助我们达到最高水平"
  },
  {
   "from": 21.33,
   "to": 23.19,
   "sid": 16,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "但我们要先把它带回最基本的地方"
  },
  {
   "from": 23.19,
   "to": 24.79,
   "sid": 17,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "所以现在的第一件事是"
  },
  {
   "from": 24.79,
   "to": 26.07,
   "sid": 18,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们要试着找到节奏"
  },
  {
   "from": 26.07,
   "to": 26.23,
   "sid": 19,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "好的"
  },
  {
   "from": 26.23,
   "to": 28.63,
   "sid": 20,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "许多年轻球员运球时实际上找不到节奏"
  },
  {
   "from": 28.63,
   "to": 30.22,
   "sid": 21,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "你的节奏准备好了"
  },
  {
   "from": 30.22,
   "to": 34.64,
   "sid": 22,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "在两次运球之间进行两次运球，开始时抬起腿"
  },
  {
   "from": 34.64,
   "to": 35.36,
   "sid": 23,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就像一个孩子"
  },
  {
   "from": 35.36,
   "to": 37.14,
   "sid": 24,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后我们要先把它放在地板上"
  },
  {
   "from": 37.14,
   "to": 38.68,
   "sid": 25,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "所以你是一二之间"
  },
  {
   "from": 38.68,
   "to": 38.98,
   "sid": 26,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "好的"
  },
  {
   "from": 38.98,
   "to": 39.48,
   "sid": 27,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就在这里"
  },
  {
   "from": 39.48,
   "to": 40.099,
   "sid": 28,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "去吧"
  },
  {
   "from": 40.28,
   "to": 42.12,
   "sid": 29,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "两个之间是的"
  },
  {
   "from": 42.12,
   "to": 43.6,
   "sid": 30,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "一二一"
  },
  {
   "from": 43.6,
   "to": 44.519,
   "sid": 31,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "太完美了"
  },
  {
   "from": 44.54,
   "to": 47.76,
   "sid": 32,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "两个之间再来一个两个之间"
  },
  {
   "from": 47.76,
   "to": 48.66,
   "sid": 33,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "别把腿抬起来"
  },
  {
   "from": 48.66,
   "to": 49.54,
   "sid": 34,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "放下你的姿势"
  },
  {
   "from": 49.54,
   "to": 50.06,
   "sid": 35,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "所有的权利"
  },
  {
   "from": 50.06,
   "to": 56.04,
   "sid": 36,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "在完美的1 2 3 1 2 3 1 2"
  },
  {
   "from": 56.04,
   "to": 57,
   "sid": 37,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "现在已经很完美了"
  },
  {
   "from": 57,
   "to": 59.64,
   "sid": 38,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就像我提到的，年轻球员实际上在这种节奏下很挣扎"
  },
  {
   "from": 59.64,
   "to": 60,
   "sid": 39,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "它的一部分"
  },
  {
   "from": 60,
   "to": 60.52,
   "sid": 40,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "当他们做的时候"
  },
  {
   "from": 60.52,
   "to": 63.36,
   "sid": 41,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "他们可能会运球三、四、五、六、七次"
  },
  {
   "from": 63.36,
   "to": 66.12,
   "sid": 42,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后把它放在中间然后用七次运球来恢复它"
  },
  {
   "from": 66.12,
   "to": 67.22,
   "sid": 43,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后把它放在"
  },
  {
   "from": 67.22,
   "to": 70.14,
   "sid": 44,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "所以你找到最适合你的号码"
  },
  {
   "from": 70.14,
   "to": 72,
   "sid": 45,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "即使中间有三次运球"
  },
  {
   "from": 72,
   "to": 73.04,
   "sid": 46,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "中间四次运球"
  },
  {
   "from": 73.04,
   "to": 75.48,
   "sid": 47,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "但你现在得和节奏保持一致"
  },
  {
   "from": 75.48,
   "to": 77.17,
   "sid": 48,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "让我们慢慢开始"
  },
  {
   "from": 77.17,
   "to": 79.09,
   "sid": 49,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "在…之间…"
  },
  {
   "from": 79.09,
   "to": 80.79,
   "sid": 50,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "当我告诉你拿起它，加快速度"
  },
  {
   "from": 80.79,
   "to": 81.55,
   "sid": 51,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后再快点"
  },
  {
   "from": 81.55,
   "to": 81.99,
   "sid": 52,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "所有的权利"
  },
  {
   "from": 81.99,
   "to": 84.17,
   "sid": 53,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "现在很好"
  },
  {
   "from": 84.17,
   "to": 86.97,
   "sid": 54,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就像你通常会完美完美"
  },
  {
   "from": 86.97,
   "to": 88.06,
   "sid": 55,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "慢慢走"
  },
  {
   "from": 88.28,
   "to": 89.02,
   "sid": 56,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "好"
  },
  {
   "from": 92.22,
